diff --git a/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt b/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1d6f3ec
--- /dev/null
+++ b/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+Whisper Web, Utilibre 81869ed-p2, 2026-10-06
+Base: https://github.com/xenova/whisper-web/tree/81869ed62970ff4373509b6004a6c9a3f0c5b64d
+Upstream MIT license retained. Utilibre changes: same-origin model/WASM loading,
+tiny quantized models only, no URL-import UI, bilingual pilot/error wording,
+audio decoding/context cleanup, 128 MiB file guard, failed-model retry recovery,
+microphone track release on stop/dismissal/late permission, and dependency fixes.
+
+Build with Node24: npm ci --ignore-scripts, restore model files using the pinned
+revisions and hashes in the published model manifest, copy onnxruntime-web/dist
+WASM files into public/wasm, then npm run build. The integration repository's
+deployment/expanded/fetch-whisper-models.mjs downloads those pinned models;
+deployment/expanded/Dockerfile.whisper serves only dist under unprivileged nginx.
+Exact deployment, headers, model downloader and check-whisper.mjs are published
+in https://github.com/mycelibre/utilibre and utilibre-integration.tar.gz.
+
+Pinned browser dependencies include Transformers.js2.17.2, React18.3.1,
+HeadlessUI1.7.19, Axios1.20.0 and protobufjs7.6.6. Sharp0.35.5 is Node-side only;
+Node modules and development servers are not shipped in the serving image.
+Production npm audit: zero known advisories on this date. Development-only
+tooling retains advisories; this is not a blanket security certification.
+
+Models/WASM/build output are not included in this source archive. Model license
+and hash manifest are served at /models/LICENSE.txt and /models/manifest.json.
+Audio remains on the visitor's device. Short-recording, export, failed-model
+recovery, invalid-file and fake-microphone lifecycle tests pass; long recordings
+and physical low-memory phones are not certified. No telemetry added.
